 "text": "Hey, good to have you along for this walk. How are you feeling? Try taking short breaks every twenty minutes to move around. A quick chat with a neighbour counts too. Fresh air helps clear the mind. Try putting it in a clip near the door instead of in your pocket. That way it' out of reach without being hidden. Try earplugs or a quiet room at the office. If you' working at home, leave the noise behind you at door. Nice of you. Our library teams love having us, and the space is always quiet.",
